{"title":"Skeleton","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 7 Skeleton that attacks with stab (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=4\">Lv 4 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=5\">Lv 5 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=6\">Lv 6 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=7\">Lv 7</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=14\">Lv 14 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=4\" title=\"Pick level 4\"><td><b>4</b></td><td>18</td><td>4</td><td>200</td><td class=\"muted\">54 · 5.6 · 600</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=5\" title=\"Pick level 5\"><td><b>5</b></td><td>20</td><td>5.1</td><td>250</td><td class=\"muted\">60 · 7.1 · 750</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>6</b></td><td>22</td><td>6.2</td><td>300</td><td class=\"muted\">66 · 8.7 · 900</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=7\" title=\"Pick level 7\"><td><b>7</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>24</td><td>7.5</td><td>350</td><td class=\"muted\">72 · 10.5 · 1,050</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skeleton?lv=14\" title=\"Pick level 14\"><td><b>14</b></td><td>43</td><td>12.2</td><td>700</td><td class=\"muted\">129 · 17.1 · 2,100</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Binx Crypt</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 8</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-21\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(2)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/skeleton-king\"><img src=\"data/img/92411ba79e0e60f9798b.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Skeleton King</b><span>Lv 6</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-bell-ringer\"><img src=\"data/img/92411ba79e0e60f9798b.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>The Bell-Ringer</b><span>Lv 14</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Skeleton: <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-man-at-arms\">Skeleton Man-at-Arms</a> <span class=\"muted\">(36)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/skeleton-knight\">Skeleton Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/grave-knight\">Grave Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/knight-commander\">Knight-Commander</a> <span class=\"muted\">(47)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh\">Virikh</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a> <span class=\"muted\">(53)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-lord\">Virikh Lord</a> <span class=\"muted\">(56)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/92411ba79e0e60f9798b.webp\" alt=\"Skeleton\"></div><h3>Skeleton</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>6</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 7)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Skeleton</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · ranged</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>22</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>6.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>300</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>5</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>10 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}